@startuml
title Countdown refresh and recovery activity

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

start
:JavaFX Timeline emits a one-second tick;
:Copy the live Farm;
:Refresh candidate plots using Clock;

if (Did any crop become ready?) then (no)
  :Refresh the UI from the live snapshot;
else (yes)
  :Save the candidate snapshot;
  if (Did the save succeed?) then (yes)
    :Publish candidate as the live Farm;
    :Refresh farm and dashboard views;
    if (Was an earlier failure reported?) then (yes)
      :Append recovery message;
      :Clear failure flag;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Keep the previous live Farm;
    if (Is this the first consecutive failure?) then (yes)
      :Append one error message;
      :Set failure flag;
    else (no)
      :Suppress duplicate error;
    endif
  endif
endif

:Wait for the next Timeline tick;
stop

note right
  The Timeline continues after a failure,
  so the next tick retries the transition.
end note

@enduml
